{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#card-zh","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型选择器扩展，将 composer 中原有的模型选择位置替换为按厂家分组的模型库。它复用 DSH 的模型目录和会话服务，提供模型搜索、能力筛选、推荐视图、收藏与最近使用记录，也能显示可选的思考档位。宿主侧还会记录模型调用的 token、时长和结果，并在设置页提供用量明细。适合需要在多个模型来源间查找、切换并查看调用用量的 DSH 用户。使用时需要 DSH 提供相应的界面、目录和会话服务；用量数据保存在本机 DSH 数据目录，模型能力元数据可能从 OpenRouter 获取。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:714","client.js:1296","client.js:2938","usage-host.js:39","usage-host.js:230"]}
{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#card-en","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus replaces the DSH web composer’s model picker with a grouped catalog for search, filters, favorites, and recommendations. Its host companion logs call usage locally and displays summaries in settings. It needs DSH slot, catalog, and session services.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:714","client.js:1296","client.js:2938","usage-host.js:39","usage-host.js:230"]}
