{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#feature-1","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus 的功能「分组模型选择」：在 DSH composer 的模型位置展示按厂家分组的目录，提供推荐、最近、收藏和全部等视图。用户选择模型后交由宿主目录切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1697","client.js:2938"]}
{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#feature-2","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus 的功能「查找与筛选」：打开模型选择器后可按厂家、模型名称、ID 或描述搜索，并按视觉、推理、工具、多模态和免费等能力筛选，结果显示匹配模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:707","client.js:714","client.js:727"]}
{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#feature-3","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus 的功能「收藏和最近使用」：用户可收藏常用模型，选择记录用于最近列表；这些偏好写入浏览器 localStorage，方便之后快速返回常用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:25","client.js:426"]}
{"unit_id":"objectyan__dsh-model-picker-plus#feature-4","repo":"objectyan/dsh-model-picker-plus","commit":"ae99a45817bc78cbc809556b4e8e91c4d832bb5f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-plus 的功能「用量统计」：宿主监听模型流事件，把调用时间、token 数量、provider、model 和结果写入本地 JSONL 账本；客户端通过共享 RPC 查看按模型汇总和近期记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["usage-host.js:39","usage-host.js:141","usage-host.js:230","client.js:804"]}
